{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Black Screen": 2,
    "Hajanad": 25,
    "Paimon": 16,
    "Player": 9
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7365201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Hajanad",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "736520101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "736520101": {
            "id": "736520101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "You're back! Ah, I've waited here for so long!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520102"
            ]
          },
          "736520102": {
            "id": "736520102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "Come, tell me how the \"Remelting Tablets\" did in detail.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520103"
            ]
          },
          "736520103": {
            "id": "736520103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hajanad seems excited.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520104"
            ]
          },
          "736520104": {
            "id": "736520104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Then we'll start with the shortcomings first! Clench your teeth!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520105"
            ]
          },
          "736520105": {
            "id": "736520105",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You describe the pros and cons of \"Remelting Tablets\" to Hajanad in detail.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520106"
            ]
          },
          "736520106": {
            "id": "736520106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "I see... I understand now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520107"
            ]
          },
          "736520107": {
            "id": "736520107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "The current explosion is not accurate enough to control the exact potion mix, so the effects can be unstable.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520108"
            ]
          },
          "736520108": {
            "id": "736520108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "What I need to do is to make a shield for the explosive, focus the resultant shockwave, and also modify the arrangement of preset tablets...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520109"
            ]
          },
          "736520109": {
            "id": "736520109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "Yes, it won't take long to make these modifications. The problem is funding...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520110"
            ]
          },
          "736520110": {
            "id": "736520110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "Fortunately, I still have my emergency funds! It should be enough if I sell the old equipment and eat once a day from now on.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520111"
            ]
          },
          "736520111": {
            "id": "736520111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You're going to eat only once a day?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520112"
            ]
          },
          "736520112": {
            "id": "736520112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "No, no! That's unacceptable! Why didn't you mention that you don't have enough funds?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520113"
            ]
          },
          "736520113": {
            "id": "736520113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "Oh, rest assured. Your payment is guaranteed. I had it all budgeted out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520114"
            ]
          },
          "736520114": {
            "id": "736520114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "I'm used to eating once a day by now. Sometimes I only have three meals in a week, so this shouldn't be a problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520115"
            ]
          },
          "736520115": {
            "id": "736520115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You don't have to try so hard...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520116"
            ]
          },
          "736520116": {
            "id": "736520116",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Now Paimon's really curious...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520117"
            ]
          },
          "736520117": {
            "id": "736520117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why do you want to become a famous researcher so bad, Ms. Hajanad?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520118"
            ]
          },
          "736520118": {
            "id": "736520118",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Are you really that into academic research? Do you want to prove your worth by doing this? Or are you planning to make a lot of Mora with alchemy?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520119"
            ]
          },
          "736520119": {
            "id": "736520119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "Hmm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520120"
            ]
          },
          "736520120": {
            "id": "736520120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "This is so out of the blue that I'm not sure either... Maybe it's just because I was bullied in the past that I got obsessed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520121"
            ]
          },
          "736520121": {
            "id": "736520121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "If I can prove my worth, then I can live a better life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520122"
            ]
          },
          "736520122": {
            "id": "736520122",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So you're doing this for that reason...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520123"
            ]
          },
          "736520123": {
            "id": "736520123",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So that's why you started to do academic research?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520124"
            ]
          },
          "736520124": {
            "id": "736520124",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "Yes. Knowledge is everything in this country, and so the only way up is through one's academic abilities.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520125"
            ]
          },
          "736520125": {
            "id": "736520125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "I don't have much talent or high intellect, so my breakthroughs are limited to unpopular subjects that no one wants to take up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520126"
            ]
          },
          "736520126": {
            "id": "736520126",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "I've been delving into my research for so long that I forgot how to act around people. Perhaps my temper's suffered for it too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520129"
            ]
          },
          "736520129": {
            "id": "736520129",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah! You already have an impressive goal now. You should try to enjoy your life!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520130"
            ]
          },
          "736520130": {
            "id": "736520130",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If you keep a normal heart and make normal conversations with people, there will definitely be those who'd like to help you with your research!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520131"
            ]
          },
          "736520131": {
            "id": "736520131",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "I know, I know. Still, thank you for the advice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520132"
            ]
          },
          "736520132": {
            "id": "736520132",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "I realized that it's much easier and more interesting to study alchemy compared to studying what to eat or what to say to others.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520133"
            ]
          },
          "736520133": {
            "id": "736520133",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "But since I've met you guys, I've been doing some self-reflection, and I believe that I should really work on my emotions and expressions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520134"
            ]
          },
          "736520134": {
            "id": "736520134",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "Anyway, thanks for helping me test out the \"Remelting Tablets.\" I should go back and write my papers now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520135"
            ]
          },
          "736520135": {
            "id": "736520135",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "In addition to the promised payment, this, too, is for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520136"
            ]
          },
          "736520136": {
            "id": "736520136",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What is this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520137"
            ]
          },
          "736520137": {
            "id": "736520137",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "My best alchemy cauldron. It cost me a great deal back then, but I treasured it so much that I never got the chance to use it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520138"
            ]
          },
          "736520138": {
            "id": "736520138",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! Why are you suddenly giving up your most precious tool?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520139"
            ]
          },
          "736520139": {
            "id": "736520139",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "\"Remelting Tablets\" are different from traditional potions. They need the equipment I newly designed to produce them, so I won't be using this cauldron anyway.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520140"
            ]
          },
          "736520140": {
            "id": "736520140",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "I did also make a promise to you, after all. Let this be a keepsake of that promise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520141"
            ]
          },
          "736520141": {
            "id": "736520141",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "You can try using it to make... tea or soup, I guess? Whatever comes out of it should taste better due to its extraordinary extraction functions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520142"
            ]
          },
          "736520142": {
            "id": "736520142",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Since you put it that way... It would be rude of us to refuse you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520143"
            ]
          },
          "736520143": {
            "id": "736520143",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You can do this, Hajanad!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520144"
            ]
          },
          "736520144": {
            "id": "736520144",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hajanad",
            "text": "Of course! Just you wait!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520145"
            ]
          },
          "736520145": {
            "id": "736520145",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Hajanad leaves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520146"
            ]
          },
          "736520146": {
            "id": "736520146",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Say, {NICKNAME}...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "736520147"
            ]
          },
          "736520147": {
            "id": "736520147",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We did a good deed this time, right?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}